        Market-status pill. NASD: "doesn't have enough padding. Button not big
        enough like the design. It also isn't clickable to the market watch
        page." It was a <Badge> — px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs, about 110x22 and not a
        link at all. The design (Figma 155:11, "Frame 145") is 145x46 with 16px
        of horizontal padding, an 8px vertical, a 24px radius and an 11px status
        dot. It now matches, and it goes to OTC Market Watch.

        Not the shared Badge any more: those numbers are specific to this pill
        and resizing Badge would have moved every other badge on the site.
      --><a href="/markets/statistics" data-market-pill class="inline-flex h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white px-4 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-800 ring-1 ring-neutral-200 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600" aria-label="OTC Market closed — view Market Watch" data-astro-cid-isef26zo><span class="relative flex size-2.5" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-isef26zo><span data-market-ping hidden class="absolute inline-flex size-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-success-500/70" data-astro-cid-isef26zo></span><span data-market-dot class="relative inline-flex size-2.5 rounded-full bg-nasd-red-500" data-astro-cid-isef26zo></span></span><span data-market-label data-astro-cid-isef26zo>OTC Market closed</span></a><button type="button" data-drawer-open class="inline-flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-md text-neutral-700 hover:bg-neutral-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 lg:hidden" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-drawer" data-astro-cid-isef26zo><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5" role="img" aria-label="Open menu"><path fill="currentColor" d="M2 4.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h15a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-15a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5m0 5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h15a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-15a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5m.5 4.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0 1h15a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1z"/></svg></button></div></div><!-- Mega menu panels (hidden by default; toggled by script) --><div id="mega-panel-0" role="region" aria-label="Markets menu" data-mega-panel hidden class="absolute inset-x-0 top-full z-30 px-4 pt-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-astro-cid-qxhoa275><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl rounded-3xl bg-white px-8 shadow-lg ring-1 ring-neutral-100" data-astro-cid-qxhoa275><p class="pt-8 text-sm text-neutral-500" data-astro-cid-qxhoa275>Markets</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-10 pt-6 p