<img src="/marketing/markets/explore-otc.webp" alt="Stylised 3D arrow chart representing OTC market growth" width="1200" height="600" loading="lazy" class="aspect-[2/1] size-full object-cover"></div></div></div></section></main><section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="newsletter-heading"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><h2 id="newsletter-heading" class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-5xl">Join our newsletter</h2><p class="mt-3 text-base text-neutral-700 sm:text-lg">Stay informed with the latest market updates, insights, and announcements from NASD.</p><form data-newsletter-form action="/api/newsletter" method="post" novalidate class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-stretch gap-3 sm:mx-auto sm:max-w-xl sm:flex-row"><label for="newsletter-email" class="sr-only">Email address</label><input id="newsletter-email" name="email" type="email" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Enter email" data-newsletter-email class="w-full rounded-md border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-neutral-900 placeholder:text-neutral-400 focus:border-nasd-blue-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-nasd-blue-600/30 sm:flex-1"><!-- Honeypot: hidden from users; bots that fill it are silently dropped. --><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-[-9999px] h-0 w-0 overflow-hidden"><label>Company<input type="text" name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><button type="submit" data-newsletter-submit class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-nasd-blue-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-nasd-blue-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60"><span data-newsletter-label>Join our newsletter</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-4" role="img" aria-label="Submit"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.837 3.13a.5.5 0 0 0-.674.74L16.33 9.5H2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0 1h13.828l-6.165 5.628a.5.5 0 0 0 .674.739l6.916-6.314a.747.747 0 0 0 0-1.108z"/></svg></button></form><!-- Turnstile renders here once the script lazy-loads (on first focus). --><div data-turnstile data-sitekey="0x4AAAAAAEV4dakQgTkdy09O" data-action="newsletter" class="mt-4 flex min-h-[65px] justify-center sm:mx-auto sm:max-w-xl [&amp;:empty]:min-h-0"></div><p data-newsletter-status role="status" aria-live="polite" class="mt-3 text-sm"></p></div></section><script type="module">document.querySelectorAll(`[data-newsletter-form]`).forEach(e=>{let t=e.querySelector(`[data-newsletter-email]`),n=e.querySelector(`[data-newsletter-submit]`),r=e.querySelector(`[data-newsletter-label]`),i=e.closest(`section`),a=i.querySelector(`[data-turnstile]`),o=i.querySelector(`[data-newsletter-status]`),s,c=!1;function l(e,t){o.textContent=e,o.className=`mt-3 text-sm ${t?`text-success-700`:`text-nasd-red-700`}`}function u(){if(c||s!==void 0)return;c=!0;let e=()=>{let e=window.turnstile;e&&(s=e.render(a,{sitekey:a.dataset.sitekey,action:a.dataset.action,appearance:`interaction-only`}))};if(window.turnstile){e();return}let t=document.createElement(`script`);t.src=`https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js?render=explicit`,t.async=!0,t.defer=!0,t.onload=e,document.head.appendChild(t)}t.addEventListener(`focus`,u,{once:!0});function d(){let t=e.querySelector(`[name="cf-turnstile-response"]`);if(t?.value)return t.value;let n=window.turnstile;return s!==void 0&&n?n.getResponse(s)??``:``}e.addEventListener(`submit`,async i=>{i.preventDefault();let a=t.value.trim();if(!/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(a)||a.length>254){l(`Please enter a valid email address.`,!1),t.focus();return}u();let o=d();if(!o){l(`Please complete the verification, then try again.`,!1);return}n.disabled=!0,r.textContent=`Subscribing…`;try{let t=await fetch(`/api/newsletter`,{method:`POST`,headers:{"content-type":`application/json`},body:JSON.stringify({email:a,token:o,company:``})}),n=await t.json().catch(()=>({}));l(n.message??(t.ok?`Thanks for subscribing.`:`Something went wrong.`),!!n.ok),n.ok&&e.reset()}catch{l(`Network error. Please try again.`,!1)}finally{let e=window.turnstile;s!==void 0&&e&&e.reset(s),n.disabled=!1,r.textContent=`Join our newsletter`}})});</script><footer class="border-t border-neutral-200 bg-white"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><!-- 5-column grid: brand + 4 nav columns --><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5"><!-- Column 1: brand block --><div class="space-y-5"><a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center " aria-label="NASD PLC home"><img src="/logos/NASD-PLC-1-1.png" alt="NASD PLC" class="w-auto h-8" width="320" height="80" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">The NASD OTC Securities Exchange is an Over The Counter (OTC) market and a Self-Regulatory Organisation, registered with and regulated by the Securities and Exchange Commission, Nigeria. NASD is also a member of the Association of Securities Exchanges of Africa (ASEA), the Lagos Chamber of Commerce and Industry (LCCI), and the Association of Securities Exchanges of Nigeria (ASEN).</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/get-started" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-nasd-blue-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-nasd-blue-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2">Get Started</a><!--
            NASD: "Live Market links to the OTC Market Watch page not the
            admitted securities page." It pointed at /markets/admitted
            (Admitted Securities); OTC Market Watch is /markets/statistics.

            Get Started above stays on /get-started deliberately: that page
            offers both routes — "Raise capital on NASD" and "Open an account
            and invest" — which suits a footer button serving both audiences,
            where /investors/get-started is investor-only.
